Withdraw_ERC4626_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when assets zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when assets non zero
   ├── when yieldVault not allowlisted
   │  └── it should revert with VaultNotAllowed
   └── when yieldVault allowlisted
      ├── given vault has not approved adapter on shares
      │  └── it should revert in the yield vault on share allowance check
      └── given vault approved adapter on shares
         ├── given assets exceeds vault position
         │  └── it should revert in the yield vault
         └── given assets within vault position
            ├── it should call yieldVault.withdraw with owner equal to vault
            ├── it should call yieldVault.withdraw with receiver equal to vault
            ├── it should transfer asset to vault
            ├── it should burn shares from vault
            └── it should return non zero sharesBurned
